implementation/java/build.gradle and resolved from Maven Central at build time.

The Isabelle Z_Machines session, declared in formal/isabelle/ROOT.

OpenModelica (OSMC Public License / GPL-3.0), used through the official Docker
image openmodelica/openmodelica in the case-study repository's re-verification
(tag and digest recorded with its results) to simulate simulation/modelica/.

